// Dialog :
"P3418985464" "Good work. Niles hurt me and my family badly when he betrayed us. Now you've made him pay for it, and you have my thanks. Oh, and the niece? Don't worry about her. We'll take her in. We'll pay for all the doctors she needs. Then we will make her into a weapon against the Council. And when she dies carrying out our revenge, then, and only then, will Niles' transgression be fully repaid."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2_PO_Vendetti_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1318146621" "The Council's finances are well protected most of the time. Usually, they're disguised as trust funds for charities. However, every now and then they have to shuffle accounts around to throw Interpol and the feds off their tracks. That leaves them vulnerable, if you know the right time and place. I know the right time and the right place. I know how vulnerable they are. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to use what I know to steal the passwords to hidden Council accounts while they're vulnerable.</A> But if you're going to do this, you better be ready to start immediately. The Council's accounts won't be vulnerable for long. You'll have maybe 90 minutes at the most."
// AcceptString :
"P1814542820" "Steal Council financial information"
// SendOffString :
"P2548685448" "There should be a number of computers in the base processing the financial data. I'll make sure you get a share. And remember: 90 minutes, tops."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3514793254" "Steal Council financial data."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P839731996" "Why are you wasting time talking to me right now? You don't have much time to waste."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2750265705" "This council base is the place where their finances are being re-laundered by computer. Too bad for them you found it."

